## Summary

US-006 is complete. Here's what was implemented:

### Server
- **`GET /gas/monthly-scorecard`** endpoint — accepts `month` (YYYY-MM) and optional `unitId`, returns:
  - Contract info (name, QDC, tolerance bands)
  - Scorecard with assertiveness rate, average accuracy rate, days data, and accumulated penalties (PVEMA + PVEME + Sobredemanda breakdown)

